    note: Visitor-facing exhibit copy; translated from existing English.
  - key: text.eb8d868177bb
    chinese: "\u5916\u58F3\u3002\n\u89C6\u7A97\u3002\n\u5185\u90E8\u89C6\u91CE\u3002"
    english: 'The shell.

      The window.

      The view within.'
    traditionalChinese: "\u5916\u6BBC\u3002\n\u8996\u7A97\u3002\n\u5167\u90E8\u8996\u91CE\u3002"
    note: Visitor-facing exhibit copy; translated from existing English.
  - key: text.35ea5649c376
